가이드라인", "company": "", "cfr": "", "ai_summary": "FDA가 'Individualized Human Genome Editing Products: Considerations for BLA Submission and Postapproval Management' 초안 가이드 발간을 관보로 공고했다. 여러 제품 변이체를 포함하는 개별화 유전자편집 제품을 단일 BLA로 제출하는 방법을 권고하며, 최종 확정 시 GE 구성요소 변이 범위의 명시와 허가 후 신규 변이체 추가 방법 등을 다룬다고 한다. 초안이며 관보 요약만 확인했고 가이드 본문은 읽지 않았다.", "summary_provider": "claude", "summary_model": "claude-code-action", "summary_status": "success", "summary_coverage": "structured_excerpt", "summary_quality": "automated_checks_only", "summary_review": {"method": "근거 인용 자동 일치 검사 · 독립 검수 아님", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-29", "scope": "공식 구조화 필드와 근거 인용을 자동 대조했습니다. 원문 전체의 사람 검수를 뜻하지 않습니다.", "source_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/28/2026-21954/individualized-human-genome-editing-products-considerations-for-bla-submission-and-postapproval", "visual_review": false}, "impact_summary": "", "background": "", "purpose": "", "changes_before": "", "changes_after": "", "affected_work": "", "recommendation": "", "key_quote": "", "importance": "보통", "tags": "RA", "created_at": "2026-10-28", "link": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/28/2026-21954/individualized-human-genome-editing-products-considerations-for-bla-submission-and-postapproval", "content_scope": "guidance", "scope_reason": "규정·가이드라인 유형 또는 명시적 GMP 단서", "topics": [], "classification_method": "source-keywords-v1", "classification_status": "pending", "inspection_end_date": "", "official_published_at": "", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-29", "last_collected_at": "2026-10-29", "collection_mode": "daily", "investigators": [], "source_link": {"kind": "document", "label": "공식 자료 열기", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/28/2026-21954/individualized-human-genome-editing-products-considerations-for-bla-submission-and-postapproval"}, "fei": "", "inspection_id": "", "facility_address": "", "record_kind": "document", "link_check": {"status": "http_ok", "http_status": 206}, "source_collection_status": "", "document_resolution": null}, {"id": "8663cb86057972064231ea3b", "title": "Adoption and Entry into force of PIC/S Recommendation (PI 058-1) - Interpretation of the most important changes in the Annex 1 on the Manufacture of Sterile Products (2022)", "country": "국제", "facility_country": "", "agency": "PIC/S", "published_date": "2026-10-28", "source_title": "PIC/S 공지", "source_type": "PIC/S 공지", "company": "", "cfr": "", "ai_summary": "", "source_summary": "<p>Geneva, 28 October 2026 PIC/S has published the Recommendation PI 058-1 - Interpretation of the most important changes in the Annex 1 on the Manufacture of Sterile Products (2022). This document was prepared by a sub-group of experts from the PIC/S-EMA-WHO Joint Implementation Working Group (A1IWG) bringing together experts from WHO, EMA, and PIC/S Participating Authorities. The A1IWG was established in January 2024 following the entry into force on 25 August 2023 of the revised Annex 1 on “sterile manufacturing of the PIC/S GMP Guide”. The document, formally adopted by PIC/S, EMA and WHO, was presented to selected Stakeholders during a Briefing Meeting (Webinar) hosted by the EMA on 22 October 2026. PI 058-1 enters into force on 28 October 2026. To download PI 058-1, please consult the page “Publication”</p>", "summary_provider": "source", "summary_model": "", "summary_status": "fallback", "summary_coverage": "extracted_body", "summary_quality": "automated_checks_only", "summary_review": null, "change_summary": "<p>Geneva, 28 October 2026 PIC/S has published the Recommendation PI 058-1 - Interpretation of the most important changes in the Annex 1 on the Manufacture of Sterile Products (2022). This document was prepared by a sub-group of experts from the PIC/S-EMA-WHO Joint Implementation Working Group (A1IWG) bringing together experts from WHO, EMA, and PIC/S Participating Authorities. The A1IWG was established in January 2024 following the entry into force on 25 August 2023 of the revised Annex 1 on “sterile 